{"text": "Vieron a un viajero que caminaba con un abrigo marrón. Decidieron observar quién lograría que se lo quitara. Acordaron actuar por turnos y sin hacerle daño. El Viento quiso intentarlo primero, muy seguro de sí mismo. Viento: Verás cómo mi soplido lo consigue.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.537374, "from": 0, "to": 6}, {"start": 0.552125, "end": 0.5964159, "from": 7, "to": 8}, {"start": 0.611208, "end": 0.758874, "from": 9, "to": 11}, {"start": 0.773666, "end": 1.305332, "from": 12, "to": 19}, {"start": 1.320083, "end": 1.467749, "from": 20, "to": 23}, {"start": 1.482541, "end": 2.102832, "from": 24, "to": 32}, {"start": 2.117583, "end": 2.353874, "from": 33, "to": 36}, {"start": 2.368625, "end": 2.516291, "from": 37, "to": 39}, {"start": 2.531083, "end": 2.944583, "from": 40, "to": 46}, {"start": 2.959375, "end": 3.47625, "from": 47, "to": 53}, {"start": 4.504375, "end": 5.257583, "from": 55, "to": 65}, {"start": 5.272333, "end": 5.877833, "from": 66, "to": 74}, {"start": 5.892583, "end": 6.128874, "from": 75, "to": 80}, {"start": 6.143666, "end": 6.763957, "from": 81, "to": 89}, {"start": 6.778708, "end": 6.941166, "from": 90, "to": 93}, {"start": 6.955916, "end": 7.118374, "from": 94, "to": 96}, {"start": 7.133166, "end": 7.251332, "from": 97, "to": 99}, {"start": 7.266083, "end": 7.842041, "from": 100, "to": 107}, {"start": 8.861041, "end": 9.569916, "from": 109, "to": 118}, {"start": 9.584708, "end": 9.968708, "from": 119, "to": 125}, {"start": 9.983458, "end": 10.219749, "from": 126, "to": 129}, {"start": 10.234541, "end": 10.795749, "from": 130, "to": 136}, {"start": 10.8105, "end": 10.884333, "from": 137, "to": 138}, {"start": 10.899083, "end": 11.150166, "from": 139, "to": 142}, {"start": 11.164916, "end": 11.622749, "from": 143, "to": 150}, {"start": 11.637541, "end": 12.095374, "from": 151, "to": 155}, {"start": 13.114375, "end": 13.350666, "from": 157, "to": 159}, {"start": 13.365416, "end": 13.764166, "from": 160, "to": 166}, {"start"